Added ``uid``, ``summary``, ``description``, and ``attendees`` pass-through properties to ``AlarmTime``, delegating to the underlying ``Alarm``. Also added a completeness test ensuring future lowercase ``Alarm`` properties are either mirrored onto ``AlarmTime`` or explicitly documented as excluded in ``INTENTIONALLY_EXCLUDED_ALARM_PROPERTIES``. Part of #1421. I used AI to assist me with this change. @nihirborkar17
